ational academic programs between China and the U.S. It has received the Irwin Sizer Award from MIT for outstanding innovation in education. The studio takes place over five weeks in June and July including several weeks in residence at Tsinghua University and two brief study tours to locations and projects that inform the work. It will include 18-20 MIT and 10-15 Tsinghua Architecture and Planning students. The Beijing City Planning Institute, responsible for strategic planning in the city, participates in the studio as the client.", "course_url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/11-307-beijing-urban-design-studio-summer-2006/", "image_url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/11-307-beijing-urban-design-studio-summer-2006/2d9bd8cd59cea6345a124694c318e43a_11-307su06.jpg", "license_name": "CC BY-NC-SA 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/", "resources": {"syllabus": true, "calendar": true, "readings": true, "lecture_notes": false, "assignments": true, "projects": true, "exams": false, "videos": false, "instructor_insights": false, "related_resources": false}, "metadata_origin": {"subject_primary": "source", "subject_secondary": "source", "academic_levels": "source", "course_feature_tags": "source"}, "capture_date": "2026-10-03", "last_verified_date": "2026-10-03", "extraction_status": "complete"}, "resources": [{"resource_id": "mitocw-11-307-summer-2006-course-home", "course_id": "mitocw-11-307-summer-2006", "resource_type": "course_home", "source_title": "Course Description", "source_url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/11-307-beijing-urban-design-studio-summer-2006/", "source_format": "html", "availability": "available", "extraction_policy": "full_text", "extraction_status": "complete", "local_path": "course-description.md", "capture_date": "2026-10-03", "content_sha256": "28787d5f36161ee30749671390ee2211bdd567e84409f3fe8e57d99f101e1272", "error": null}, {"resource_id": "mitocw-11-307-summer-2006-syllabus", "course_id": "mitocw-11-307-summer-